      "notes": "Unary minus binds tighter than `^`, and `^` groups left to right, so this is (2^-3)^2. The engine evaluates 2^-3 and drops the trailing `^2`.",
      "status": "known-failure",
      "defect": "associativity",
      "actual": 0.125
    },
